# Commands
## Delay shuttle round end
emergency-shuttle-command-round-desc = 停止紧急穿梭机离开超空间时结束回合的计时器。
emergency-shuttle-command-round-yes = 回合已延迟。
emergency-shuttle-command-round-no = 无法延迟回合结束。

## Dock emergency shuttle
emergency-shuttle-command-dock-desc = 呼叫紧急穿梭机并将其停靠到空间站……如果可行的话。

## Launch emergency shuttle
emergency-shuttle-command-launch-desc = 如果可能，提前发射紧急穿梭机。

# Emergency shuttle
emergency-shuttle-left = 紧急穿梭机已离开空间站。预计 {$transitTime} 秒后穿梭机抵达中央指挥部。
emergency-shuttle-launch-time = 紧急穿梭机将在 {$consoleAccumulator} 秒后发射。
emergency-shuttle-docked = 紧急穿梭机已停靠在空间站的{$direction}，{$location}。它将在 {$time} 秒后离开。{$extended}
emergency-shuttle-good-luck = 紧急穿梭机无法找到空间站。祝你好运。
emergency-shuttle-nearby = 紧急穿梭机无法找到有效的停靠端口。它已跃迁至空间站的{$direction}，{$location}。它将在 {$time} 秒后离开。{$extended}
emergency-shuttle-extended = {" "}由于不便的情况，发射时间已延长。

# Emergency shuttle console popup / announcement
emergency-shuttle-console-no-early-launches = 提前发射已禁用
emergency-shuttle-console-auth-left = 还需 {$remaining} 次授权才能提前发射穿梭机。
emergency-shuttle-console-auth-revoked = 提前发射授权已撤销，还需 {$remaining} 次授权。
emergency-shuttle-console-denied = 访问被拒绝

